@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 215
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
hide circle
hide empty members
package "处方与实际发药（院内按条件启用）" as P {
' @reference patient
class "患者" as patient_p <<entity>>
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_p <<entity>>
' @reference material
class "材料" as material_p <<entity>>
' @reference inventory_movement
class "库存变动" as inventory_p <<entity>>
' @reference bill_item
class "应收项目" as bill_item_p <<entity>>
class "处方" as prescription <<entity>> {
 开立牙医、时间、取药路径
 草稿／已开立／已作废
 审核状态、审核人及意见
 用药指导、交付与更正依据
 --
 +暂存处方草稿()
 +开立处方(就诊与权限)
 +记录审方结果(资格与意见)
 +核对实际发药条件()
 +作废未交付处方(原因)
 +核对处方就诊归属()
}
class "处方明细" as prescription_item <<entity>> {
 开立时药名规格
 用法用量、疗程、单位
 开立数量
 --
 +核对药品规格与用法()
 +计算剩余可发量(实际已发量)
}
class "实际发药" as dispense_record <<entity>> {
 实际正数量、交付时间
 核发人、用药交代
 --
 +核对批次效期及可用量()
 +登记实际交付(数量与原单)
}
patient_p "1" -- "0..*" prescription
visit_p "1" -- "0..*" prescription
prescription "1" *-- "0..*" prescription_item
material_p "1" -- "0..*" prescription_item
prescription_item "1" -- "0..*" dispense_record
inventory_p "1" -- "0..1" dispense_record
dispense_record "0..1" -- "1" bill_item_p
patient_p -[hidden]right- visit_p
inventory_p -[hidden]right- bill_item_p
note bottom of dispense_record
院内：资质与审方通过后，才按实际量发药。
累计发药量≤有效开立量，且不超可用库存。
发药、同源出库及费用来源共同保存；
缺价留待核价，不能补成零价。
院外：不产生诊所发药、出库及药品应收。
end note
}
@enduml
